@startuml
' Facade Pattern adapted to HealthTech.
' Suggested LaTeX placement: normal page.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

class "separation.py Router" as SeparationRouter {
  +postSeparate(audioId)
}

class SeparationService <<Facade>> {
  +runSeparation(audioId)
  -createJob(audioId)
  -completeJob(jobId, result)
  -failJob(jobId, errorMessage)
}

class AudioPreprocessor <<Subsystem>> {
  +loadWav(path)
  +toMono(waveform)
  +resampleIfNeeded(waveform, targetRate)
}

class NeoSSNetInference <<Subsystem>> {
  +loadModel(checkpointPath, configPath)
  +generateOutput(waveform)
}

class StorageService <<Subsystem>> {
  +saveHeartOutput(jobId, waveform)
  +saveLungOutput(jobId, waveform)
  +resolveUploadPath(audioId)
}

class DatabaseSession <<Subsystem>> {
  +insertJob(audioId, modelId)
  +insertResult(resultData)
  +updateJobStatus(jobId, status)
  +writeLog(logData)
}

class ModelRepository {
  +findActiveModel()
}

SeparationRouter --> SeparationService : one workflow call
SeparationService --> AudioPreprocessor
SeparationService --> NeoSSNetInference
SeparationService --> StorageService
SeparationService --> DatabaseSession
SeparationService --> ModelRepository
ModelRepository --> DatabaseSession

note bottom
  Mapping:
  Client = separation.py Router
  Facade = SeparationService
  Subsystems = AudioPreprocessor, NeoSSNetInference, StorageService, DatabaseSession
end note

@enduml
